NavAI documents scoring with uzbek_text_norm (Apache-2.0). If that package is
installed, eval uses it. The committed subset numbers in this repo state which
normalizer actually ran.

Evaluation audio is streamed from the public google/fleurs uz_uz test split
(CC-BY-4.0) at eval time. It is not stored in this repository and is never used
for training.
